== Trivia ==
* This is the only mode to have every [[Enemies|Enemy]] in the game.
* Toilet Fortress is the only map that has endless difficulty currently.
* The Episode 70 Part 1 update made this mode have more unique boss and the boss cycle ends at wave 100 with '''[[Mutant Pumpkin Toilet]]''' pushed from being the boss in wave 80 to 90.
* When Endless Mode came out, there was a UGC item called [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/15921511009/Toilet-Wings Toilet Wings] that could have been obtained via beating wave 40 of Endless Mode which isn't obtainable anymore
* This mode can summon event Enemies.
* [[Upgraded Titan Drill Man]] used to be the Endless Reward for being in the Top 100, but was replaced by [[Sinister Titan Clockman]].
* The first 50 waves here are even harder than Nightmare mode

